    traitPositions: []
    nameCorner: {x: 1868, y: 830}
    background: By most metrics, Ruy pretty much had a perfect life. He was born to an oil tycoon and always grew up with the best. The best school, the best cars, the best clothes. Any hardship that did come his way, toss it a wad of money and it all went away. After years of being the best, it can get kinda boring though... Ruy decided he wanted to take on something new, so he joined a street fighting ring called the IDBF (Illicit Downtown Brawling Federation). He always wanted to be part of the fights he had seen in his favorite movies. Starting off, he couldn't even land a hit on the other guy, and the beatings hurt bad. But this was new, and finally something exciting. He's going to keep training to become the best street fighter in the world. Well, he's kinda been taken from the world now, so he's training to be the best of the Renegades until he can return to Earth to be the best there...
    skills:
    - name: 'LIGHT: JAB'
      description: A quick, straight punch.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'HEAVY: KICK'
      description: A slower kick with longer reach.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'GRAB: THROW'
      description: Grabs up close and tosses the opponent. Hold back to throw them behind you.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'SPECIAL: SHADOKEN'
      description: Hold to charge, release to throw a fireball. The longer the charge, the harder it hits. Only one can be on screen at a time.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'ULTIMATE: HORYUKEN'
      description: A rising uppercut that's invincible as it starts and launches the opponent sky-high. Very punishable if blocked.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'PERK: RAGE'
      description: The more health he's lost, the harder all of his attacks hit.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
  - label: Odette
