    - {x: 1915, y: 375}
    nameCorner: {x: 1868, y: 800}
    background: A creation carefully concocted throughout the 1830s and 1850s, 0d3tte was originally built as a toy. She traveled all around Europe, amazing everyone from the baker's wife to the emperor with her song and dance. Day and night, day and night, it was the same song and dance... until that fateful day when her partner dropped her. The streets say it was jealous sabotage, but regardless, with a missing arm and irreparable damage throughout, she was now defective for the stage. Still, 0d3tte was an expensive toy, so the theater quickly installed a pen nib replacement and put her to work transcribing sheet music for the ballet she once performed. Then, the aliens took her as a specimen of mechanical life. Now that they have given her a new life, she has transformed from a delicate doll to a dazzling dagger.
    skills:
    - name: 'LIGHT: JAB'
      description: A quick one-armed jab.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'HEAVY: LEG SWEEP'
      description: A rising kick that also catches opponents jumping in.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'GRAB: SHORT GRAB'
      description: Less reach than most grabs, but a little faster.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'SPECIAL: REFLECTIVE CANVAS'
      description: Briefly raises a canvas that sends enemy projectiles back as her own. It doesn't stop close-up attacks.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'ULTIMATE: PAINT SPLAT'
      description: A fast shot that can't be blocked, only jumped. On a hit, it scrambles the opponent's controls for a few seconds.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'PERK: FEARLESS RUSH'
      description: Her forward dash is invincible. Her back dash costs her a little health.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'PERK: PAINT SKATING'
      description: Every hit she lands leaves a paint puddle. On paint, she moves faster and her opponent moves slower.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
