    - {x: 1045, y: 395}
    nameCorner: {x: 1835, y: 815}
    background: In the day of the caveman, it was not the lion nor the tiger nor the snake the people feared. It was him. He was the king of the jungle. A being of a different plane. Everyone foolishly thought they could hunt him down and feed their tribes for months. But he persisted. Each time hunters went after him, he would stomp them out, then go to their village to ruin their food stores and demolish their meager homes of mud and stone. He would never be happy until his revenge was served. He is yet to be addressed. Unfortunately, they managed to accidentally take him, but this is not the same as defeat. He WILL get his revenge. It's just a matter of when.
    skills:
    - name: 'LIGHT: TRUNK WHIP'
      description: A short, heavy swing of the trunk.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'HEAVY: TRUNK SLAM'
      description: Slow to start, but hits like a falling tree.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'GRAB: TRUNK GRAB'
      description: Holds the opponent in his trunk. Use Vine Boom during the hold for a hit that can't miss; otherwise he throws them.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'SPECIAL: VINE BOOM'
      description: Hits everything around him and destroys enemy projectiles.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'ULTIMATE: ADDRESS ME'
      description: He grows huge for a few seconds. Everything he does gets bigger and stronger, and hits can't stagger him.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'PERK: STAMPEDE'
      description: His forward dash is an attack, and it charges further the more he's hurt.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'PERK: UNSTOPPABLE'
      description: He can't block, but he has more health than anyone and shrugs off slows, scrambles and bleeding.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
  - label: Patience
    characterId: 14
    backing: {fileID: 21300000, guid: eb6d9c69865f84df7bf9bdda8fddb2a5, type: 3}
