    traitPositions:
    - {x: 1915, y: 8}
    - {x: 1915, y: 130}
    nameCorner: {x: 1868, y: 830}
    background: 'Believed to be the messenger of a deity brought into existence by a cult, Patience carries out judgment upon those whom their deity has deemed the scourge of humankind: the ones who do not feel guilt or seek redemption for their transgressions. For these people, Patience feels only wrath, contempt, and disgust, and Patience will ensure that they seek atonement whether they want to or not. Patience does have a soft spot for those who punish themselves through feelings of pure remorse and seek atonement before Patience''s involvement. For these people, Patience will come to them and provide them a way to obtain absolution for their transgressions. Patience does not hate humanity; rather, they hate the pain and unhappiness that humanity causes, and they seek to purge the pain and unhappiness in the world, no matter the cost.'
    skills:
    - name: 'LIGHT: WHIP'
      description: A short lash that makes the opponent bleed.
      icon: {fileID: 3295952983093669455, guid: e08ef3666fd17124caee27ac5123fae6, type: 3}
    - name: 'HEAVY: CHARGED WHIP'
      description: Hold to charge for extra reach, release to lash. Makes the opponent bleed.
      icon: {fileID: 160827616729360741, guid: e30326aa1512419428b5b01fbe085a5d, type: 3}
    - name: 'GRAB: IRON MAIDEN'
      description: A very close-range grab that drags the opponent in and makes them bleed.
      icon: {fileID: -6074570768989678322, guid: 55b6c97976c00024cbb77b5697b8bc62, type: 3}
    - name: 'SPECIAL: BEAR TRAP'
      description: Sets a trap at their feet that springs when stepped on. Jump to avoid it. It can't be blocked, slows the victim and makes them bleed.
      icon: {fileID: -8505558789975680994, guid: d11ebbfde14be924187521107561bb88, type: 3}
    - name: 'ULTIMATE: GUILLOTINE'
      description: Marks the opponent's spot, then drops an unblockable blade there. Get out of the outline!
      icon: {fileID: -8505558789975680994, guid: d11ebbfde14be924187521107561bb88, type: 3}
    - name: 'PERK: BLEED'
      description: Bleeding drains health over time, and a badly bleeding opponent hits weaker.
      icon: {fileID: -930959773470151156, guid: b534e0fd69b98d543b11df7785f86434, type: 3}
    - name: 'PERK: DISMEMBER'
      description: Keep landing hits and the opponent is slowed down.
      icon: {fileID: 3979066852195711896, guid: 116d0c6c959842f46994056e3f6baa74, type: 3}
  - label: Dr. Remy
    characterId: 15
    backing: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0f4b8a8bf315e4a3583dc3f8e748d04b, type: 3}
