    nameCorner: {x: 1868, y: 830}
    background: 'The year is 2000. Kennith''s mom had just dropped him off at the mall again. She couldn''t afford a proper babysitter, so the next best thing was to drop Kennith off at the mall with $10 and let him have fun. Kennith spent a lot of time at Hort''s Hefty Arcade and got really, really good at every machine, the name "K3N" always being the top scorer of the month. On this fateful day, though, Hort brought out a new arcade machine: "Tech Tonic." Kennith immediately fell in love with the game and started grinding all day long as Ruy to prepare for the game''s first tournament. Out of nowhere, a trunk reached out of the screen and grabbed Kennith into the game. Somehow, despite no words being spoken by this creature, K3N knew his mission: humble Ruy. Even though he''s not from this world, he understands that he won''t be able to return until the Renegades'' mission is complete.'
    skills:
    - name: 'LIGHT: CAPE WHIP'
      description: A jab with a little extra reach.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'HEAVY: CHARGED PUNCH'
      description: Hold to charge, release to punch. The longer the charge, the harder it hits.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'GRAB: HAND GRAB'
      description: A slower grab that holds the opponent before throwing them.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'SPECIAL: RAPID PUNCHES'
      description: Hold to keep throwing flurries of jabs.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'ULTIMATE: INSTALL'
      description: Powers up with any amount of meter. While the meter drains, he hits harder and his moves have no cooldowns. Press again to switch it off.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'PERK: SECOND WIND'
      description: His moves recover faster as he loses health.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
