    nameCorner: {x: 1868, y: 830}
    background: '[???] used to be his name. Once an actor in the 1950s, [???] was a master at his craft, appearing in all of the biggest films. He was beloved by all for years, but one day, the crowds stopped coming. The next big thing had arrived, and [???] was the face of yesterday. He needed to do something different, so he decided to try method acting. One week he was a prince, the next a gangster, and the next even a dinosaur (that was a weird moment). After living so many different lives, it''s easy to start losing grip of which one is your own. Eventually, [???] was given the identity of Noir: your classic rootin'' tootin'' cowboy who''s going to stop the town''s bad guy and get the girl. Noir did the job well, and the crowds once again knew his name, but Noir did not. Noir became obsessed with riding his horse and hunting down bad guys. He often got into brawls on the street and was kicked out of many, many bars. One day, amidst his crisis, Noir disappeared. Everyone thought he got himself killed in a street fight, but in reality, maybe one day Noir will return.'
    skills:
    - name: 'LIGHT: FIRE'
      description: An instant, long-range shot from his revolver.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'HEAVY: THROW GUN'
      description: Tosses his gun in a slow, short arc. Don't worry, he has more.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'GRAB: LASSO'
      description: Ropes the opponent from a distance and pulls them in.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'SPECIAL: BULLET'
      description: A fast shot that crosses the whole stage with big knockback. He only has a few bullets each round, so make them count.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'ULTIMATE: RAPID FIRE'
      description: For a few seconds, unlimited bullets that fire almost nonstop.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'PERK: HORSEBACK'
      description: 'His dashes are on horseback: long and fast.'
      icon: {fileID: 0}
    - name: 'PERK: POINT BLANK'
      description: Every hit knocks the opponent back harder the closer they are.
      icon: {fileID: 0}
